  "description": "Adds a Signature field type to Umbraco Forms, letting someone sign a form with a mouse, finger or stylus. The signature is captured on a canvas and stored on the record as a JPEG data URL, so it needs no file storage and renders anywhere the record does - including the back office entry view and printed output.",
